      "writtenOn": "2023-11-29T12:37:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You copied the logic from pvmfw, but not the comment - and that\u0027s quite important.\n```\n        // Mode is supposed to be encoded as a 1-byte bstr, but some implementations instead\n        // encode it as an integer. Accept either. See b/273552826.\n        // If Mode is omitted, it should be treated as if it was Unknown, according to the Open\n        // Profile for DICE spec.\n```\nI suggest copying it here - and as mentioned below, you need to handle the omitted case.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 225,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 236,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "0b7295df65e93f3373993516ad90b3ebd7bd4940",
