      "writtenOn": "2023-11-29T12:37:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The spec allows Mode to be omitted, in which case it is treated as Unknown (ie not secure).\nAlso: I suspect Payload and Builder should just have setters/getters for an integer Mode; we can use that to determine is_secure.",
